epean Sea Road, Walkeshwar and Kemps Corner Malabar Hill.\n\n[Explore Malabar Hill](https://www.magicbricks.com/Malabar-Hill-in-Mumbai-Overview)\n\nMumbai Real Estate Market Report | Jan-Mar 2026\n\n[Download](https://property.magicbricks.com/microsite/research-insights/reports/prop-index-mumbai-q1-2026-april-2026.html)\n\nAverage Rate\n\n₹71172 per sqft\n\n3.3% (for last month)\n\nDemand Supply\n\nHigh Demand\n\nLow Supply\n\nAnnual Yield\n\n3.3 %\n\nMumbai Real Estate Report\n\nMumbai | Jan-Mar 2026\n\nSource: MagicBricks Research\n\n[Download Report](https://property.magicbricks.com/microsite/research-insights/reports/prop-index-mumbai-q1-2026-april-2026.html)\n\n### Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nRatings & Reviews\n\nA Peaceful Spiritual Oasis Malabar Hill is unique\n\nA Peaceful Spiritual Oasis Malabar Hill is unique because we have the Banganga Tank nearby. The spiritual vibe combined with the absolute silence at night makes our home feel very special.\n\n- Guest User, Owner\n\nMorning Walks Amidst Greenery I start my days\n\nMorning Walks Amidst Greenery I start my days jogging through the Hanging Gardens. Living in Malabar Hill feels like a hill station because of the lush trees and quiet streets.\n\n- Guest User, Owner\n\n[View all Reviews](https://www.magicbricks.com/flats-in-malabar-hill-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs)\n\nMorning Walks Amidst Greenery I start my days\n\nMorning Walks Amidst Greenery I start my days jogging through the Hanging Gardens. Living in Malabar Hill feels like a hill station because of the lush trees and quiet streets.\n\n- Guest User, Owner\n\nSerene Views and Fresh Air Living here provides\n\nSerene Views and Fresh Air Living here provides a much-needed sanctuary from Mumbai's frantic pace. Our apartment overlooks the Queen's Necklace, and the sea breeze keeps the air remarkably fresh. Safety is never a concern for us given the high-profile security. Malabar Hill truly remains the most peaceful and prestigious address for my family's lifestyle.\n\n- Guest User, Owner\n\n4.4/5\n\nMalabar Hill Rating Based on 57 Reviews\n\nEnvironment\n\n4.6\n\nEnvironment 4.4/5\n\nNeighbourhood 4.6\n\nRoads 4.5\n\nSafety 4.7\n\nCleanliness 4.6\n\nCommuting\n\n4.4\n\nCommuting 4.4/5\n\nPublic Transport 4.6\n\nParking 4.3\n\nConnectivity 4.5\n\nTraffic 4.3\n\nPlaces of Interest\n\n4.2\n\nPlaces of Interest 4.4/5\n\nSchools 4.4\n\nHospitals 4.1\n\nRestaurants 3.9\n\nMarkets 4.5\n\n## Flats Price Trend in Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nAverage Flat Price in Malabar Hill\n\n₹80936/ sq.ft 17% QoQ*\n\nNearby Locality (Avg. Price / sq.ft)\n\nNS Patkar Marg\n\n₹78199/ sq.ft 15% QoQ*\n\nChembur\n\n₹24654/ sq.ft 2% QoQ*\n\nCumballa Hill\n\n -- *\n\nPrice Trends\n\n1Y 3Y 5Y\n\nTable View\n\nQuarter Malabar Hill\n\n(% Change in Q-o-Q)NS Patkar Marg\n\n(% Change in Q-o-Q)Chembur\n\n(% Change in Q-o-Q)Cumballa Hill\n\n(% Change in Q-o-Q)\nApr-June'26₹ 80936/ sq.ft 17%₹ 78199/ sq.ft 15%₹ 24654/ sq.ft 2%--\nJan-Mar'26₹ 69326/ sq.ft-6%₹ 68091/ sq.ft-7%₹ 24165/ sq.ft 1%--\nOct-Dec'25₹ 73525/ sq.ft 5%--₹ 23976/ sq.ft 1%₹ 71630/ sq.ft-1%\nJul-Sept'25₹ 69866/ sq.ft-4%--₹ 23734/ sq.ft-1%₹ 72284/ sq.ft 1%\n\nYear Malabar Hill\n\n(% Change in Y-o-Y)NS Patkar Marg\n\n(% Change in Y-o-Y)Chembur\n\n(% Change in Y-o-Y)Cumballa Hill\n\n(% Change in Y-o-Y)\n2025₹ 69489/ sq.ft 9%₹ 69876/ sq.ft 13%₹ 23448/ sq.ft 7%₹ 65226/ sq.ft 16%\n2024₹ 63991/ sq.ft 9%₹ 61576/ sq.ft 6%₹ 21827/ sq.ft 8%₹ 56163/ sq.ft 1%\n2023₹ 58641/ sq.ft 5%--₹ 20203/ sq.ft 4%₹ 55685/ sq.ft 2%\n\nYear Malabar Hill\n\n(% Change in Y-o-Y)NS Patkar Marg\n\n(% Change in Y-o-Y)Chembur\n\n(% Change in Y-o-Y)Cumballa Hill\n\n(% Change in Y-o-Y)\n2025₹ 69489/ sq.ft 9%₹ 69876/ sq.ft 13%₹ 23448/ sq.ft 7%₹ 65226/ sq.ft 16%\n2024₹ 63991/ sq.ft 9%₹ 61576/ sq.ft 6%₹ 21827/ sq.ft 8%₹ 56163/ sq.ft 1%\n2023₹ 58641/ sq.ft 5%--₹ 20203/ sq.ft 4%₹ 55685/ sq.ft 2%\n2022₹ 56091/ sq.ft-6%--₹ 19435/ sq.ft 5%₹ 54486/ sq.ft 1%\n2021₹ 59387/ sq.ft 3%--₹ 18505/ sq.ft 2%₹ 53848/ sq.ft 2%\n\n*Based on Apr-June'26 Quarter data. All data based on Flats available for sale on MagicBricks.\n\n[Malabar Hill Property Price Trends](https://www.magicbricks.com/Property-Rates-Trends/Multistorey-Apartment-rates-Malabar-Hill-in-Mumbai)\n\n## Newly Posted Flats for sale in Malabar Hill\n\n![Image 44: 1560 Sq-ft 2 BHK Flat](https://img.staticmb.com/mbphoto/property/cropped_images/ver2/XIwvQlc61t8ZIpanz4mAnzVE88E9dM_BhmyJqlls6lUvwfTXnsZw/Photo_h180_w240/75701555_7_IMG_20190213_160817[1]_180_240.jpg)\n\n[2 BHK Flat](https://www.magicbricks.com/propertyDetails/2-BHK-1560-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Malabar-Hill-in-Mumbai&id=4d423735373031353535)\n\n₹ 9 Cr 1560 Sq-ft\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nPosted: Aug 29, 2026\n\n## Explore Localities near Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n[Chembur](https://www.magicbricks.com/Chembur-in-Mumbai-Overview)\n\n₹ 18,183 - ₹ 30,148 per sqft\n\n4.0 Ratings (298 Reviews)\n\nChembur is basically a launchpad for people working in BKC. Leaving the neighborhood during peak hours is a nightmare because the Santacruz Chembur Link Road and Amar Mahal junction turn into complete parking lots. The Monorail is practically useless for daily office runs, and the newer metro lines still aren't fully integrated. It’s an uneven mix of old industrial lanes and new high rises, and landlords charge massive premiums for it.\n\nRead More\n\n[Flats for sale in Chembur Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/flats-in-chembur-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs \"Flats for sale in Chembur Mumbai\")\n\n[Napean Sea Road](https://www.magicbricks.com/Napean-Sea-Road-in-Mumbai-Overview)\n\n₹ 47,468 - ₹ 87,319 per sqft\n\n4.5 Ratings (42 Reviews)\n\nNapean Sea Road is a good locality. It has good connectivity to school, college, hospital, bank and market.\n\nRead More\n\n[Flats for sale in Napean Sea Road Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/flats-in-napean-sea-road-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs \"Flats for sale in Napean Sea Road Mumbai\")\n\n[NS Patkar Marg](https://www.magicbricks.com/NS-Patkar-Marg-in-Mumbai-Overview)\n\n₹ 47,948 - ₹ 88,234 per sqft\n\n2.8 Ratings (1 Reviews)\n\nWell locality with ample features in Precious place. Well close to N S Patkar road.easy to access all type of Market, Greenery, Mall, public transport. It is provided like ICICI, HDFC, Kotak bank. Education status like new era school, RTI school several montesory .Hospitals like saffire hospital,ICON Hospitals etc.Easy to all necessary mejor available it near by.\n\nRead More\n\n[Flats for sale in NS Patkar Marg Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/flats-in-ns-patkar-marg-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs \"Flats for sale in NS Patkar Marg Mumbai\")\n\n[Gamdevi](https://www.magicbricks.com/Gamdevi-in-Mumbai-Overview)\n\nUpto ₹ 95,411 per sqft\n\n4.6 Ratings (9 Reviews)\n\nGamdevi is a good locality. It has good connectivity to school, college, hospital, bank and market.\n\nRead More\n\n[Flats for sale in Gamdevi Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/flats-in-gamdevi-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs \"Flats for sale in Gamdevi Mumbai\")\n\n[Altamount Road](https://www.magicbricks.com/Altamount-Road-in-Mumbai-Overview)\n\nUpto ₹ 93,168 per sqft\n\n4.4 Ratings (29 Reviews)\n\nIt's the best part of South Mumbai, clean roads, peaceful and green cover. It's an ideal spot for any small family to live and bring up a child, with the best schools nearby and perfect for shopping. \n\nRead More\n\n[Flats for sale in Altamount Road Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/flats-in-altamount-road-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs \"Flats for sale in Altamount Road Mumbai\")\n\n[Pedder Road](https://www.magicbricks.com/Pedder-Road-in-Mumbai-Overview)\n\n₹ 41,986 - ₹ 69,125 per sqft\n\n4.3 Ratings (48 Reviews)\n\nPedder Road is a good locality. It is close to good schools, colleges and hospitals. It is well connected to all parts of South Mumbai. \n\nRead More\n\n[Flats for sale in Pedder Road Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/flats-in-pedder-road-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs \"Flats for sale in Pedder Road Mumbai\")\n\n[Bhulabhai Desai Marg](https://www.magicbricks.com/Bhulabhai-Desai-Marg-in-Mumbai-Overview)\n\n₹ 41,062 - ₹ 69,713 per sqft\n\n4.4 Ratings (2 Reviews)\n\nBhulabhai Desai Marg is a good locality. It is close to good schools, colleges and hospitals. It is well connected to all parts of South Mumbai. \n\nRead More\n\n[Flats for sale in Bhulabhai Desai Marg Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/flats-in-bhulabhai-desai-marg-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs \"Flats for sale in Bhulabhai Desai Marg Mumbai\")\n\n[Cumballa Hill](https://www.magicbricks.com/Cumbala-Hill-in-Mumbai-Overview)\n\nUpto ₹ 1.7 Lac per sqft\n\n4.4 Ratings (6 Reviews)\n\nIt is a good locality. It is close to good schools colleges and hospitals. It is a cosmopolitan society \n\nRead More\n\n[Flats for sale in Cumballa Hill Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/flats-in-cumbala-hill-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs \"Flats for sale in Cumballa Hill Mumbai\")\n\nShow More\n\nFlats in Malabar Hill\n\n*   [1 BHK Flats in Malabar Hill](https://www.magicbricks.com/1-bhk-flats-in-malabar-hill-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs)\n*   [2 BHK Flats in Malabar Hill](https://www.magicbricks.com/2-bhk-flats-in-malabar-hill-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs)\n*   [3 BHK Flats in Malabar Hill](https://www.magicbricks.com/3-bhk-flats-in-malabar-hill-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs)\n*   [4 BHK Flats in Malabar Hill](https://www.magicbricks.com/4-bhk-flats-in-malabar-hill-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs)\n*   [5 BHK Flats in Malabar Hill](https://www.magicbricks.com/5-bhk-flats-in-malabar-hill-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs)\n\nFlat in Popular Localities of Mumbai\n\n*   [Flats in Andheri East](https://www.magicbricks.com/flats-in-andheri-east-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs)\n*   [Flats in Chembur](https://www.magicbricks.com/flats-in-chembur-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs)\n*   [Flats in Borivali West](https://www.magicbricks.com/flats-in-borivali-west-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs)\n*   [Flats in Virar West](https://www.magicbricks.com/flats-in-virar-west-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs)\n*   [Flats in Kandivali West](https://www.magicbricks.com/flats-in-kandivali-west-mumbai-for-